# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:4
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_14742abf:

    # "Approaching the tavern, I suddenly caught the scent of a strange aroma, like wildflowers that made me stop and turn to look around."
    "酒場に近づくと、突然、不思議な香りが漂ってきた。野の花のようなその香りに、思わず足を止めて辺りを見回した。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:5
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_5d368305:

    # BLACK "{i}Mate... A good potential mate is near...{/i}"
    BLACK "{i}伴侶…理想的な伴侶が近くにいる…{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:7
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_86a5ea2e:

    # "Looking around, I once again took a deep breath, and my eyes naturally drew the beauty heading in the opposite direction of me."
    "周囲を見渡し、私はもう一度深呼吸を繰り返した。すると、自然と視線が、私と反対方向に歩いていく美しさへと吸い寄せられた。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:8
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_f19d39bc:

    # "Aristocratic, she wore a beautiful blue dress and bonnet hat that elegantly conveyed a sense of class and sensuality."
    "貴族的な佇まいの彼女は、青いドレスとボンネットハットを身にまとっており、それらは上品さと官能性を感じさせるものだった。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:9
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_544fac9c:

    # "Her face was soft, with long auburn brown hair that flowed with some of the bluest eyes I'd ever seen."
    "彼女の顔は柔らかく、長い赤褐色の髪は、私が今まで見た中でも最も青い瞳と共に流れるように揺れていた。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:11
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_3c0eb2fc:

    # BLACK "(We should follow her...)"
    BLACK "(彼女を追うべき…)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:12
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_7f781590:

    # MC "(I... No, I have to meet Markus.)"
    MC "(私…いや、マーカスに会わなければ。)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:14
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_f5c76856:

    # MC "(I need to stay focused on things... talk to him first before anything else.)"
    MC "(気を引き締めて…まずは彼と話そう。)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:15
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_56f195ef:

    # BLACK "(I will keep her scent for as long as I can to track her...)"
    BLACK "(彼女の香りをたよりに、できる限り追い続けよう…)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:16
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_ddc022fb:

    # MC "(You can do that?)"
    MC "(それができるの？)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:17
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_d33bd2a7:

    # BLACK "(Of course, there are many things you will have to learn.)"
    BLACK "(無論、学ぶべきことは数多くあるでしょう。)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:18
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_5cc5173a:

    # MC "(...)"
    MC "(……)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:25
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_59fae255:

    # MARKUS "Over here, I have a table for us."
    MARKUS "こちらにテーブルを用意しました。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:27
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_391745f2:

    # "Sitting at the table with Markus, we ordered a round of Ale over and sat back talking about the things that had happened."
    "マーカスとテーブルに向かい合い、エールを一巡注文すると、私たちは背もたれに寄りかかり、起こった出来事について語り合った。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:28
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_3a3ca78b:

    # "Markus seemed jovial, elated even with everything going on, grinning merrily as he talked about his plans for the future, whereas I remained much more... {i}reserved.{/i}"
    "マルクスは陽気で、周囲の状況にもかかわらず上機嫌で、将来の計画について楽しげに笑いながら話していた。一方、私はもっと…{i}控えめ{/i}だった。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:34
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_bd1d77d0:

    # MARKUS @ smile "This is perfect for us!"
    MARKUS @ smile "これは私たちにぴったりだ!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:35
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_1ba1cd79:

    # MARKUS "All we need to do is write a few speeches, smile and wave at some drunks in a tavern or two and make sure to visit a brothel once or twice in the meanwhile!"
    MARKUS "あとは演説を何本か書いて、酒場の酔っ払いどもに笑顔で手を振り、ついでに娼館にも一度や二度顔を出すだけでいいんだからさ!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:36
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_ae75d1f4:

    # MC @ talk "Somehow, I don't think everything is going to be quite as easy as you think."
    MC @ talk "何だか、君が思ってるほど全てがうまくいくとは思えないな。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:37
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_54702566:

    # MARKUS @ angry "You over worry."
    MARKUS @ angry "心配しすぎだよ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:38
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_e9f73ef7:

    # MC @ talk "And you don't worry enough."
    MC @ talk "そして、あなたは十分に心配しない。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:39
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_e49e0a40:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Bah!"
    MARKUS @ angry "ふん!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:40
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_053903ef:

    # MC @ talk "Markus, we hardly know anything about what's happened to us aside from what we've been told."
    MC @ talk "マーカス、私たちに起きたことについては、聞かされたこと以外ほとんど何も知らないわ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:41
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_fceb992d:

    # MARKUS "What more do you need to know?"
    MARKUS "ほかに何を知る必要がある？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:42
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_f355bdbb:

    # MARKUS "They made the rules fairly clear friend, and quite frankly, I'm looking forward to {i}finally{/i} having things easy for a while."
    MARKUS "奴らはルールをかなり明確にしてくれたよ、相棒。そして率直に言って、{i}ようやく{/i}しばらくは楽ができると思うと楽しみだね。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:43
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_c3f06f55:

    # MC @ talk "Will it be easy though Markus, {i}will it really?{/i}"
    MC @ talk "本当に簡単だろうか、マーカス、{i}本当にそうなのか？{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:44
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_b25bf2ac:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MARKUS "{i}【ため息】{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:45
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_3b37031c:

    # "Markus pulled a sympathetic face, leaning closer towards me."
    "マルクスは同情したような顔をして、僕の方に身を乗り出してきた。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:46
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_29dedb3b:

    # MARKUS @ sad "{i}Haven't we been through enough already?{/i}"
    MARKUS @ sad "{i}もう十分じゃないか？{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:47
translate ja ev_markus_tavern_a350546d:

    # MARKUS "Okay, things didn't exactly work out like we planned but..."
    MARKUS "よし、計画通りにはいかなかったけど…"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:52
translate ja act1scene8_menu_3e3a04a9:

    # MARKUS "What about it?"
    MARKUS "それで？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:53
translate ja act1scene8_menu_18283bb2:

    # MARKUS @ angry "We did our part, we nearly {i}fucking died{/i} doing our part."
    MARKUS @ angry "我々は役目を果たした、その過程で{i}クソもう少しで死ぬところだった{/i}。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:54
translate ja act1scene8_menu_cc4c4b12:

    # MARKUS "What more can they ask?"
    MARKUS "これ以上何を求めようというのか？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:59
translate ja act1scene8_menu_6b3c3a5f:

    # MARKUS "I don't think we're going to have much luck there, these... {i}'things'{/i} aren't in any book I've read."
    MARKUS "あそこは上手くいかないと思うよ、この…{i}化け物{/i}は、私が読んだことのあるどの本にも載っていないからね。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:60
translate ja act1scene8_menu_ef6be862:

    # MARKUS "And it's too much of a risk to talk to someone about all this."
    MARKUS "そして、こういうことを誰かに話すのはリスクが大きすぎる。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:61
translate ja act1scene8_menu_bfa7261f:

    # MARKUS "It only takes one wrong person blabbering and we'll find the inquisitors knocking on our doors."
    MARKUS "ただ一人でも間違った人が口を滑らせれば、我々の扉を尋問者が叩くことになってしまう。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:62
translate ja act1scene8_menu_7e68f3ed:

    # "Taking a sip of my drink, I pondered in thought."
    "一口飲みながら、考え込んでいた。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:63
translate ja act1scene8_menu_a633c971:

    # MC @ talk "...That skeleton down in the caverns."
    MC @ talk "あの地下洞窟の骸骨は。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:64
translate ja act1scene8_menu_e4805c34:

    # MARKUS "The mage?"
    MARKUS "魔法使いか？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:65
translate ja act1scene8_menu_ca48a8a6:

    # "Markus leaned forward to whisper the next words."
    "マルクスは次の言葉を囁くために身を乗り出した。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:66
translate ja act1scene8_menu_fd965436:

    # MARKUS "{i}The dark mage?{/i}"
    MARKUS "{i}闇の魔導師？{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:67
translate ja act1scene8_menu_2c8cee45:

    # MC @ talk "The letter said they were excavating those pillars."
    MC @ talk "手紙には、あの柱を発掘していると書かれていた。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:68
translate ja act1scene8_menu_97db8ee0:

    # MARKUS "...So?"
    MARKUS "……それで？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:69
translate ja act1scene8_menu_6f48e853:

    # MC @ talk "Don't you remember the big hurry to get us out there?"
    MC @ talk "俺たちを外に連れ出すのに大慌てだったのを覚えてないのか？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:70
translate ja act1scene8_menu_4f3400b3:

    # MARKUS "..."
    MARKUS "…"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:71
translate ja act1scene8_menu_ed9d5533:

    # MC @ talk "Markus, we were sent there to {i}recover{/i} these things."
    MC @ talk "マーカス、我々はこれらを{i}回収{/i}するために遣わされたのよ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:72
translate ja act1scene8_menu_d74b6226:

    # MARKUS "Well... Mission bloody accomplished I guess."
    MARKUS "まあ…任務は見事に果たしたとでも言うべきか。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:73
translate ja act1scene8_menu_97da4cce:

    # MC @ angry "No, idiot! Don't you see?"
    MC @ angry "いいえ、バカ!分からないの？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:74
translate ja act1scene8_menu_064713d7:

    # MC @ talk "That means {i}someone{/i} somewhere still knows about these things."
    MC @ talk "つまり、{i}どこかに{/i}まだこのことを知っている誰かがいるということなのか。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:75
translate ja act1scene8_menu_4f3400b3_1:

    # MARKUS "..."
    MARKUS "…"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:76
translate ja act1scene8_menu_2cf2700a:

    # MC @ talk "And if they don't assume they were lost during the battle, they'll be looking for them."
    MC @ talk "そして、彼らが戦闘中に失ったと思わなければ、それらを探すことになる。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:77
translate ja act1scene8_menu_2519b1d2:

    # MARKUS @ shock "{i}...You think someone's after us?{/i}"
    MARKUS @ shock "{i}…誰かに追われてると思う？{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:78
translate ja act1scene8_menu_231d56ef:

    # MC @ talk "I don't know, maybe?"
    MC @ talk "さあ、どうかな…"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:79
translate ja act1scene8_menu_d794d778:

    # MC @ talk "{i}We were{/i} the only survivors..."
    MC @ talk "{i}私たちは{/i}唯一の生存者だった…"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:80
translate ja act1scene8_menu_34432b32:

    # MC @ talk "If I was {i}them,{/i} I'd look for us."
    MC @ talk "もし私が{i}彼らなら、{/i}私たちを探すだろう。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:81
translate ja act1scene8_menu_d578b222:

    # "Markus seemed to ponder the thought for a moment, and we both were awkwardly silent till Markus finally asked:"
    "マルクスは一瞬、その考えに思いを巡らせているようだった。そして私たちは不自然な沈黙に包まれたが、ついにマルクスが尋ねたのだ："

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:82
translate ja act1scene8_menu_8a0ce398:

    # MARKUS "Alright... Then tell me this, why haven't they already?"
    MARKUS "よし…では、一つ教えてくれ。なぜ、彼らはまだそれをしていないんだ？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:83
translate ja act1scene8_menu_bf1a78a6:

    # MC @ talk "Hm?"
    MC @ talk "ふむ？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:84
translate ja act1scene8_menu_7b79cb54:

    # MARKUS @ sad "If they know about our 'gifts' and know about us, why haven't we been arrested by inquisitors already?"
    MARKUS @ sad "彼らが我々の『能力』を知り、我々のことを知っているなら、なぜ我々はまだ審問官に逮捕されていないのでしょうか？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:85
translate ja act1scene8_menu_1ab560af:

    # MC @ talk "Good question."
    MC @ talk "いい質問ですね。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:86
translate ja act1scene8_menu_094dccc2:

    # MC @ sad "I don't know."
    MC @ sad "わからない。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:87
translate ja act1scene8_menu_0b75be23:

    # "Markus smirked and sipped his drink."
    "マルクスは冷笑いを浮かべ、飲み物を一口飲んだ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:88
translate ja act1scene8_menu_397f68f7:

    # MARKUS @ joy "See? You're always over-thinking."
    MARKUS @ joy "ほら？君はいつも考えすぎだよ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:89
translate ja act1scene8_menu_89f856d2:

    # MARKUS "That place was all bones and ruin... Whoever set it up is probably just like that mage you found, dead and gone."
    MARKUS "あの場所は骨と廃墟ばかりだった…仕掛けた者も、きっと君が見つけたあの魔術師と同じく、死んで消え去ったのだろう。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:90
translate ja act1scene8_menu_cfcd1b36:

    # MC @ talk "Then why the sudden push for us to go there?"
    MC @ talk "じゃあ、なぜ急にそこに行くよう押し付けてくるの？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:91
translate ja act1scene8_menu_60fe80b3:

    # MARKUS "Who knows! Maybe someone who knew someone heard there was weapons there or important information."
    MARKUS "さてね!誰かから聞いた噂で、そこに武器や重要な情報があると知った人がいたのかも。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:92
translate ja act1scene8_menu_81b4cae8:

    # MARKUS "Maybe they wanted the place retaken for strategic reasons, maybe a hundred other possible reasons!"
    MARKUS "おそらく戦略的理由でこの場所を奪還したかったのか、おそらくその他百通りの可能性があったのだろう!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:93
translate ja act1scene8_menu_8418a966:

    # MC @ talk "..."
    MC @ talk "……"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:95
translate ja act1scene8_menu_2768b216:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Unless we're given a reason to be worried, I'm not going to be."
    MARKUS @ smile "心配する理由を与えられない限り、私はするつもりはない。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:100
translate ja act1scene8_menu_cd202ec0:

    # MARKUS @ smile "See? Everything will work out."
    MARKUS @ smile "ね？全てうまくいくよ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:101
translate ja act1scene8_menu_5bac0092:

    # MARKUS "You just need to relax, {i}our{/i} war is over."
    MARKUS "ただリラックスすればいい、{i}俺たち{/i}の戦いは終わったんだ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:105
translate ja act1scene8_menu2_b56d841c:

    # MARKUS @ sad "What?"
    MARKUS @ sad "え？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:106
translate ja act1scene8_menu2_0d809304:

    # MC @ talk "What if things take a turn for the worst Markus?"
    MC @ talk "最悪の方向に転がったらどうするんだ、マーカス？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:107
translate ja act1scene8_menu2_fbcbd5dc:

    # MC @ talk "What {i}if{/i} the Demorai push us back and it looks-"
    MC @ talk "もし{i}も{/i}デモライに押し戻されて、その姿が"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:108
translate ja act1scene8_menu2_cbaea7ad:

    # MARKUS @ sad "That won't happen for years even if it does."
    MARKUS @ sad "仮にそうなったとしても、それは何年も先の話だ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:109
translate ja act1scene8_menu2_21198188:

    # MC @ talk "But what happens if it does? What if we settle down, have families and those things are clawing at our doors and it's all too late because we did nothing now?"
    MC @ talk "でも、もしそうなったら？　もし私たちが生活を築き、家族を持ち、そのときになってそれらが扉に爪を立てて押し寄せてきたら？　今なにもしなかったから、もう手遅れだなんてことになったら？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:110
translate ja act1scene8_menu2_38a5e93a:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Then we'll fight, or we'll flee when the time comes..."
    MARKUS @ angry "それでは戦うか、それともいざとなったら逃げるか……"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:115
translate ja act1scene8_menu2_20910c7f:

    # MARKUS "Ha!"
    MARKUS "はっ!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:116
translate ja act1scene8_menu2_ae7c2b09:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Thanks but, I just left one battlefield littered with bodies and don't really need to see another."
